---
const navLinks = [
  { href: '/', label: 'Inicio' },
  { href: '/sobre-nosotros', label: 'Sobre nosotros' },
  { href: '/marchas', label: 'Marchas' },
  { href: '/activaciones', label: 'Activaciones' },
  { href: '/testeos', label: 'Testeos' },
  { href: '/chatbot', label: 'ChatBOT' },
];

const volunteersURL = 'https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=BwTI_RcvzEyEEY2A9ZRVQtC7SGGmRJxGgSMEBVVaKU9UREVTNk41UUtXSFJRUDRMSlA2WThLWU81US4u';
const sponsorsEmail = 'mailto:juanse.barrio@aidshealth.org';
const instagramURL = 'https://www.instagram.com/impulsebsas';
---

<footer class="bg-surface border-t border-border py-10 md:py-16">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-10 md:gap-12">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <a href="/" class="inline-block" aria-label="Inicio">
          <img
            src="/images/logos/logo-azul.png"
            alt="Impulse Buenos Aires"
            class="h-10 w-auto"
          />
        </a>
        <p>Buenos Aires, Argentina</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted">
          Parte de Impulse Group · Con el apoyo de AHF
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <h3 class="footer-heading">Navegá</h3>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          {
            navLinks.map((link) => (
              <li>
                <a href={link.href} class="footer-link">
                  {link.label}
                </a>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <h3 class="footer-heading">Contacto</h3>
        <p>¿Querés sumarte o trabajar con nosotros?</p>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <a
            href={volunteersURL}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="footer-link"
          >
            Formulario voluntarios →
          </a>
          <a href={sponsorsEmail} class="footer-link">
            Empresas y sponsors →
          </a>
        </div>
        <a
          href={instagramURL}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="footer-social mt-2"
          aria-label="Instagram de Impulse Buenos Aires"
        >
          <svg
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            width="20"
            height="20"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5" />
            <path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z" />
            <line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.5" y2="6.5" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p>© 2026 Impulse Buenos Aires. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
      <p>
        Diseñado y desarrollado por
        <a
          href="https://www.js80.studio"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="js80-link"
        >JS80</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .footer-link {
    color: var(--color-text);
    transition: color var(--transition);
    display: inline-block;
    width: fit-content;
  }
  .footer-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .footer-social {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    color: var(--color-text);
    transition: color var(--transition), border-color var(--transition);
  }
  .footer-social:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .footer-bottom {
      flex-direction: row;
      justify-content: space-between;
      text-align: left;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }

  .js80-link {
    color: var(--color-text);
    transition: color var(--transition);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .js80-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
</style>
